(v)
the occasional letting out on hire to the municipality or hiring from the municipality of any article for an amount not
exceeding in the aggregate in any one year five hundred rupees;
(d)
employed as a paid legal practitioner on behalf of the council or as a legal practitioner against the council;
(e)
