(g)
as to the preparation of plans and estimates for works which are to be partly or wholly constructed at the expense of the
council and the power of to municipal authorities or officers of the Government, to accord professional or administrative
sanction to estimates;
(h)
as to the accounts to be kept by the council, the manner in which such accounts shall be audited and published and as
to the conditions under which the rate-payers may appear before auditors, inspect books and vouchers and take
exception to items entered or omitted therein;
(i)
as to the estimates of receipts and expenditure, returns, statements and reports to be submitted by council;
